{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51400","headline":"过桐庐场郑判官 · 施肩吾","name":"过桐庐场郑判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荣阳郑君游说余，偶因榷茗来桐庐。\n幽奇山水引高步，暐煜风光随使车。\n算緍百万日不虚，吏人业里唯簿书。\n眼前横制断犀剑，心中暗转灵蛇珠。\n有时退公兼退食，一尊长在朱轩侧。\n胡商大鼻左右趍，赵妾细眉前後直。\n醉来引客上红楼，面前一道桐溪流。\n登临山色在掌内，指点霞光随杖头。\n东郭野人慵栉沐，使将破履升华屋。\n数杯酩酊不得归，楼中便盖江云宿。\n却被江郎湿我衣，赖君借我貂襜归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"施肩吾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51400.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51400","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}